WEBVTT

00:03.121 --> 00:06.001
<b>You are one of the Seafolk, correct?</b>

00:06.001 --> 00:07.541
<b>Who's asking?{What if I am?}{I had this less literal version, then I decided to revert it when I found out just how literal the original was, then I realized just how well this version works in context}</b>

00:09.131 --> 00:12.051
<b>You must be another soldier—</b>

00:12.051 --> 00:13.841
<b>I am here to eliminate you.</b>

00:32.651 --> 00:34.491
<b>Was that…</b>

00:34.491 --> 00:35.911
<b>the last of them?</b>

00:38.071 --> 00:39.781
<b>Wow!</b>

00:39.781 --> 00:40.541
<b>Awesome!</b>

00:40.541 --> 00:41.541
<b>Amazing!{these aren't great but how the hell do you subtitle a crowd}</b>

00:41.541 --> 00:43.961
<b><i>They must have been terrified{desperate}.{cornered, panicked etc}{rephrase please}</i></b>

00:50.501 --> 00:51.671
<b>Now I'm angry.</b>

00:52.511 --> 00:55.051
<b>I'm gonna tear you to shreds.{why was this changed}</b>

00:55.431 --> 00:57.341
<b>I let my guard down again.</b>

00:57.341 --> 00:59.681
<b>I never learn.</b>

