03:25.121 --> 03:28.751
<b>Those who can walk, leave the shelter now!</b>

03:29.161 --> 03:30.661
<b>I cannot promise I will win.</b>

03:31.541 --> 03:34.001
<b>Run, while I keep him busy!</b>

03:38.801 --> 03:43.971
<b>None of you monkeys will escape me!</b>

04:09.831 --> 04:11.251
<b>Lightning Eye!</b>

04:14.371 --> 04:15.121
<b>I can't see!</b>

04:19.421 --> 04:22.091
<b>Machine Gun Blows!</b>

04:26.091 --> 04:28.851
<b>You <i>do</i> like combo attacks, don't you?</b>

04:38.361 --> 04:40.821
<b>Y-You can do it!</b>

04:40.821 --> 04:42.031
<b>Quiet!</b>

04:45.491 --> 04:47.821
<b>Now you melt, girl.</b>

05:19.021 --> 05:21.021
<b>If you had just focused on me,</b>

05:23.031 --> 05:27.411
<b>you could've easily dodged my little ball of acid.</b>

05:27.411 --> 05:30.531
<b>Instead, you chose to sacrifice yourself to save some brat{a runt}.</b>

05:30.531 --> 05:35.411
<b>You're a fool, but I give you credit for giving me a few scratches.</b>

05:36.371 --> 05:38.421
<b>They've already healed, of course.</b>

05:39.001 --> 05:40.421
<b>Now, die.</b>

05:41.501 --> 05:43.591
<b>Justice Crash!</b>

05:51.301 --> 05:54.971
<b>The righteous cyclist, Mumen Rider, is here!</b>

05:56.981 --> 05:58.901
<b><i>The top-ranked hero in Class C?</i></b>

05:59.851 --> 06:00.941
<b>D-Don't…</b>

06:01.441 --> 06:02.941
<b>It's Mumen Rider!</b>

06:03.441 --> 06:05.611
<b>Mumen Rider came for us.</b>

06:06.571 --> 06:07.701
<b>But he…</b>

06:09.861 --> 06:11.411
<b>I'm bored already.</b>

06:27.011 --> 06:29.431
<b>Oh, my apologies.</b>

06:29.721 --> 06:32.181
<b>I nearly forgot to kill you.</b>

06:33.721 --> 06:35.851
<b>Justice Tackle!</b>

06:45.071 --> 06:46.611
<b>Nobody expects much…</b>

06:51.911 --> 06:53.241
<b>…from me.</b>

06:54.121 --> 06:58.411
<b>They think a C-class hero won't be much help.</b>

07:03.461 --> 07:06.461
<b>I know that better than anyone!</b>

07:06.461 --> 07:08.631
<b>I'm not good enough for Class B.</b>

07:09.671 --> 07:13.431
<b>I'm weak. I know that much.</b>

07:14.851 --> 07:19.391
<b>No one has to tell me I don't stand a chance against you.</b>

07:19.391 --> 07:21.311
<b>I already know that!</b>

07:22.981 --> 07:26.071
<b>What are you babbling about?</b>

07:26.071 --> 07:27.691
<b>Begging for your life?</b>

07:28.401 --> 07:30.741
<b>And yet, I have to{must} try.</b>

07:32.701 --> 07:35.201
<b>It's not about winning or losing!</b>

07:35.201 --> 07:40.201
<b>It's about me taking you on 
right here, right now!</b>

07:44.381 --> 07:48.801
<b>Enough of your rambling. 
Time to finish you off.</b>

07:50.921 --> 07:51.881
<b>You can do it!</b>

07:53.431 --> 07:57.011
<b>Mumen Rider, you can do it!</b>

07:58.391 --> 08:01.891
<b>You're the cyclist of justice!</b>

08:03.351 --> 08:06.651
<b>Beat that weird monster! 
Beat him up!</b>

08:07.271 --> 08:09.781
<b>You can do it!</b>

08:10.321 --> 08:11.941
<b>Yeah, get him!</b>

08:11.941 --> 08:13.571
<b>Beat him up!</b>

08:13.571 --> 08:16.281
<b>We're counting on you, Mumen Rider!</b>

08:16.281 --> 08:17.201
<b>We believe in you!</b>

08:17.201 --> 08:18.331
<b>Beat him!</b>

08:18.331 --> 08:19.911
<b>You can do it!</b>

08:38.641 --> 08:41.021
<b>I think not!</b>

08:46.061 --> 08:48.401
<b>You did well. Nice fight.</b>

08:50.481 --> 08:54.281
<b>Well, well. Has yet another piece of garbage washed up on my shore?</b>

08:56.781 --> 08:58.371
<b>H-Hey, Genos!</b>

08:58.371 --> 09:00.741
<b>Are you still alive?!</b>

09:01.411 --> 09:03.581
<b>Mas{… }ter…</b>

09:05.831 --> 09:08.041
<b>Hang on for a second.</b>

09:08.041 --> 09:10.501
<b>I gotta pound this Seafreak
 or whatever it's called{its name is}.</b>

09:12.091 --> 09:13.591
<b>I heard that!</b>

09:19.391 --> 09:20.721
<b>Impressive.</b>

09:20.721 --> 09:23.521
<b>You're still on your feet 
after one of my punches.</b>

09:24.231 --> 09:27.231
<b>Clearly you're different 
from the rest of this trash.</b>

09:27.231 --> 09:30.521
<b>Huh? Your punch was too weak, that's all.</b>

09:31.021 --> 09:33.111
<b>Hey, someone else is over there.</b>

09:33.111 --> 09:35.491
<b>Who is that? A hero?</b>

09:35.491 --> 09:36.321
<b>That head…</b>

09:36.741 --> 09:38.531
<b>I remember it from the Hero Registry.</b>

09:38.531 --> 09:41.331
<b>I know him! He's a C-class rookie.</b>

09:41.331 --> 09:42.871
<b>I think he's rank 2.</b>

09:42.871 --> 09:44.451
<b>C-class?</b>

09:44.451 --> 09:48.001
<b>So we're all still gonna die{gonna get killed}…</b>

09:48.001 --> 09:51.001
<b>But that punch didn't hurt him at all.</b>

09:51.001 --> 09:52.041
<b>That's your imagination.</b>

09:52.551 --> 09:56.801
<b>You saw how many heroes were 
blown away by that thing's punches, right?</b>

09:58.721 --> 10:03.261
<b>I am the Deep Sea King, Lord of the Seas.</b>

10:03.261 --> 10:07.561
<b>The sea is mother to all life on Earth.{All life on Earth comes from the sea, as if she were our mother.}{if this is too short, revert back to original line}</b>

10:07.561 --> 10:10.231
<b>In other words, as ruler of the seas,</b>

10:10.231 --> 10:16.071
<b>I am the pinnacle of all living organisms on the planet!{of a pyramid that includes every living organism on this world!}</b>

10:16.071 --> 10:17.701
<b>To defy me is to{means}—</b>

10:17.701 --> 10:20.031
<b>Yeah, yeah, I got it.</b>

10:20.031 --> 10:21.951
<b>It's raining, so let's get this over with.</b>

10:44.761 --> 10:47.311
<b>What?!</b>

10:47.311 --> 10:48.021
<b>Awesome!</b>

10:48.021 --> 10:49.351
<b>That was amazing!</b>

10:51.901 --> 10:52.651
<b>Thank goodness!</b>

10:52.651 --> 10:53.981
<b>He did it!</b>

11:02.821 --> 11:04.071
<b><i>Well, that was lame.</i></b>

11:04.621 --> 11:07.081
<b><i>I kinda had my hopes up, too.</i></b>

11:14.211 --> 11:17.131
<b>I'm back with my weapons.</b>

11:17.131 --> 11:19.971
<b>But damn you, Deep Sea King.</b>

11:19.971 --> 11:21.261
<b>You got away.</b>

11:35.111 --> 11:37.781
<b>Hey, what's that?</b>

11:38.571 --> 11:39.781
<b>It is the mail.</b>

11:41.201 --> 11:45.991
<b>The post office can no longer deliver here, 
so mail is now sent by drone.</b>

11:45.991 --> 11:47.451
<b>A{The} post office{'s} drone?</b>

11:47.451 --> 11:50.961
<b>No, it belongs to the Hero Association.</b>

11:50.961 --> 11:52.121
<b>I see.</b>

11:54.251 --> 11:59.171
<b>The public sends these to the heroes, 
much like fan letters.</b>

