12:24.991 --> 12:28.491
m 703.5 745.5 l 867 831 817.5 888 639 807

12:24.991 --> 12:28.491
To C-Class Hero 
Saitama

12:25.321 --> 12:26.661
<b>How dare they…</b>

12:26.661 --> 12:28.491
<b>I'll find out who sent it.</b>

12:28.991 --> 12:30.741
<b>This guy sure has some free time.</b>

12:37.921 --> 12:39.841
<b>All it took was one punch!</b>

12:39.841 --> 12:42.091
<b>One punch! Just one!</b>

12:42.091 --> 12:43.921
<b>Is he really C-class?</b>

12:43.921 --> 12:45.261
<b>He's too strong!</b>

12:45.261 --> 12:47.221
<b>Or maybe…</b>

12:47.221 --> 12:51.271
<b>the monster wasn't really that tough?</b>

12:51.271 --> 12:54.351
<b>But so many heroes went down fighting him.</b>

12:54.351 --> 12:57.731
<b>That just means those heroes were weaklings.</b>

12:58.111 --> 13:03.191
<b>Maybe… I suppose the monster didn't look all that tough when he killed it.</b>

13:03.191 --> 13:07.741
<b>After all, a C-class hero 
took it out with a single punch!</b>

13:07.741 --> 13:09.491
<b>What's that say about the heroes it beat?</b>

13:10.371 --> 13:13.331
<b>They may call themselves A-class or S-class,</b>

13:13.331 --> 13:15.751
<b>but their titles don't mean a thing.</b>

13:17.251 --> 13:20.881
<b>Hey, enough of that! 
They risked their lives for us!</b>

13:20.881 --> 13:24.381
<b>Risked their lives? Anyone can do that.</b>

13:24.381 --> 13:26.011
<b>But a "hero" has to beat monsters.</b>

13:26.631 --> 13:30.051
<b>It all ended well this time, so whatever.</b>

13:30.051 --> 13:36.021
<b>But it's annoying when heroes who are really just 
average Joes show up and try to save you.</b>

13:36.521 --> 13:38.061
<b>If you're gonna call yourself a hero, then—</b>

13:38.061 --> 13:39.771
<b>Shut your fat mouth!</b>

13:40.311 --> 13:43.111
<b>Why are you getting mad at me?</b>

13:43.111 --> 13:46.451
<b>The Hero Association gets their funds 
from our donations, right?</b>

13:46.451 --> 13:50.281
<b>As long as we're paying for it, 
they'd better protect us.</b>

13:50.741 --> 13:54.911
<b>The fact of the matter is that bald guy 
pretty much took care of it all by himself.</b>

13:55.621 --> 13:58.211
<b>So all the other heroes died for nothing.</b>

13:58.211 --> 14:01.671
<b>Anyone can come up with 
a way to buy a little time.</b>

14:01.671 --> 14:05.961
<b>In the end, the other "heroes" didn't do anything heroic.</b>

14:05.961 --> 14:07.471
<b>I said shut up!</b>

14:07.471 --> 14:10.261
<b>We were all saved. Just leave it at that.</b>

14:10.261 --> 14:11.011
<b>Exactly!</b>

14:15.971 --> 14:17.641
<b>Today's my lucky day!</b>

14:18.271 --> 14:22.901
<b>The other heroes wore the monster down, 
so beating it was a piece of cake{kid's play}!</b>

14:24.021 --> 14:25.821
<b>Good thing I was late.</b>

14:25.821 --> 14:29.281
<b>I barely did a thing, and now I get all the credit.</b>

14:29.281 --> 14:32.491
<b>Hey, spread the word, all of you!</b>

14:32.491 --> 14:35.491
<b>I'm the one who finished the monster off!</b>

14:35.491 --> 14:39.921
<b>I'll beat the snot out of anyone who says 
{it's only 'cause }the hard work was already done for me{I got here late}!</b>

14:39.921 --> 14:41.291
<b>What's he mean?</b>

14:41.291 --> 14:43.461
<b>The monster was already weak?</b>

14:43.461 --> 14:44.211
<b>Huh?</b>

14:44.211 --> 14:46.921
<b>Hang on a sec. That's Saitama!</b>

14:46.921 --> 14:48.131
<b>Saitama?</b>

14:48.131 --> 14:52.091
<b>He's the hero from City Z that everyone calls a fraud{cheat}.</b>

14:52.091 --> 14:53.801
<b>What? A fraud{cheat}?</b>

14:53.801 --> 14:57.561
<b>He appeared out of nowhere 
and climbed the ranks super fast.</b>

14:57.561 --> 14:59.061
<b>Yeah, pretty fishy.</b>

14:59.061 --> 15:00.101
<b>Hey, you guys!</b>

15:00.691 --> 15:03.691
<b>Look after the fallen heroes, okay?</b>

15:03.691 --> 15:07.611
<b>If they die on me, how am I 
gonna cash in on their work?</b>

15:07.611 --> 15:09.111
<b>He <i>is</i> a fraud{cheat}!</b>

15:09.111 --> 15:10.451
<b>Man, that's no fair.</b>

15:10.451 --> 15:12.111
<b>So he's just taking the credit?</b>

15:12.411 --> 15:16.161
<b>Compared to him, the other heroes 
seem a little more heroic.</b>

15:16.161 --> 15:19.501
<b>If it weren't for all the other heroes…{Where would we be now…}</b>

15:19.501 --> 15:20.961
<b>what would've happened?{if the other heroes hadn't fought?}</b>

15:21.331 --> 15:25.341
<b>Yeah, I feel so grateful to them all.</b>

15:28.961 --> 15:30.341
<b><i>Master Saitama…</i></b>

15:31.131 --> 15:33.051
<b><i>Is this really what you want?</i></b>

15:33.511 --> 15:35.391
<b>Hey, it stopped raining.</b>

15:36.011 --> 15:41.561
<b><i>If this is the path you choose to walk, 
I will not interfere.</i></b>

15:42.351 --> 15:47.111
<b><i>But in the future, if you are ever forced into a corner by this,</i></b>

15:48.651 --> 15:50.491
<b><i>at that moment, I will—</i></b>

15:50.491 --> 15:52.451
<b>Hey, there's one more.</b>

