16:20.311 --> 16:22.681
<b>CITY Z</b>

16:20.311 --> 16:22.681
<b>HERO ASSOCIATION OFFICE</b>

16:22.231 --> 16:25.311
<b>So, why'd you call me in?</b>

16:25.941 --> 16:28.571
<b>When you registered with the Hero Registry,</b>

16:28.571 --> 16:30.941
<b>you were given the Association handbook.</b>

16:31.491 --> 16:36.991
<b>Haven't you read it? 
It lists all our rules and regulations.</b>

16:36.991 --> 16:39.411
<b>Yeah, I guess I've got it somewhere.</b>

16:39.951 --> 16:44.081
<b>No matter. Congratulations on 
attaining rank 1 in Class C.</b>

16:44.081 --> 16:46.081
<b>Hm? Oh, I see.</b>

16:46.081 --> 16:49.211
<b>So you guys are the ones who decide the hero rankings.</b>

16:49.211 --> 16:52.551
<b>There are more members on the review board,</b>

16:52.551 --> 16:55.971
<b>but the four of us here today 
will be handling your interview.</b>

16:55.971 --> 16:56.721
<b>Interview?</b>

16:57.221 --> 17:03.141
<b>The top ranking C-class hero is given 
the option to be promoted to Class B.</b>

17:03.141 --> 17:06.561
<b>However, if you wish to remain in Class C, that's fine too.</b>

17:06.561 --> 17:08.231
<b>How about it, Mr. Saitama?</b>

17:08.611 --> 17:10.401
<b>Will you{Do you want to} move up to Class B?</b>

17:10.401 --> 17:13.361
<b>{Although }If you do, you'll be at the 
bottom of your class{ranked at the very bottom} again.</b>

17:13.361 --> 17:17.321
<b>I'm fine either way, 
but I guess I'll try moving up.</b>

17:17.861 --> 17:20.371
<b>That way, I won't have to deal with weekly quotas.{There'll be no more weekly quotas that way.}</b>

17:21.081 --> 17:26.121
<b><i>Besides, with Genos in Class S, 
I can't stick around in Class C forever.{I can't stick to Class C forever with Genos in Class S.}</i></b>

17:26.501 --> 17:29.291
<b>I see, so you want a promotion.</b>

17:29.291 --> 17:33.511
<b>First, we'll have you{need you to} answer a few{some} questions 
and undergo a psychoanalysis{psychological testing}.{I don't feel too great about this line but I feel like it's an improvement}</b>

17:35.091 --> 17:36.721
<b>This Saitama…</b>

17:36.721 --> 17:40.971
<b>He's the one who finished off the Deep Sea King.</b>

17:40.971 --> 17:42.221
<b>What do you think?</b>

17:42.221 --> 17:44.141
<b>Some say he's a fraud.</b>

17:44.471 --> 17:50.151
<b>He broke every record{set new overall records} in the fitness exam, 
so his physical ability is solid.</b>

17:50.151 --> 17:55.321
<b>Well, according to rumors, 
he cheated on the exams, too.</b>

17:55.321 --> 17:57.031
<b>Rumors are just rumors.</b>

17:57.451 --> 18:00.871
<b>No sense in doubting him now.</b>

18:00.871 --> 18:03.371
<b>The bottom line is, he wants to move up.</b>

18:03.701 --> 18:06.751
<b>Why not let him go for now?</b>

18:06.751 --> 18:09.631
<b>If he's for real, he'll make it in Class B.</b>

18:10.501 --> 18:14.761
<b>But if he's a fake, he'll soon regret it.</b>

18:15.591 --> 18:18.761
<b>He is entering a cruel and callous world.</b>

18:19.181 --> 18:21.761
<b>We'll cross that bridge when we get to it{must}.</b>

18:22.101 --> 18:24.141
<b>Promotion to Class B?</b>

18:25.471 --> 18:28.101
<b>You interrupted my filming for this?</b>

18:28.101 --> 18:30.521
<b>This isn't worthy of my attention.{It's not something that needs my attention.}</b>

18:30.521 --> 18:33.151
<b>This is a decision for the executive committee.</b>

18:33.151 --> 18:34.401
<b>Listen.</b>

18:34.401 --> 18:38.701
<b>I only want to be consulted{input on managing} about 
heroes in Class A and above,</b>

18:38.701 --> 18:41.031
<b>since they have a strong impact on society.</b>

18:41.031 --> 18:42.991
<b>As a hero in the same class,</b>

18:42.991 --> 18:46.331
<b>if they're inadequate, it hurts my image too.</b>

18:46.331 --> 18:48.161
<b>Especially this last incident…</b>

